# Form: significant activity record

Use for a meaningful engineering turn/decision, not a heartbeat, daily quota or second
tracker. Default output: append a dated section to the existing project journal;
only create `docs/research/<milestone>-journal.md` if it deserves an independent record.
Copy payload only; [metadata](../../references/metadata.md) applies to a new durable
file, not every appended section. Essential: change, reason/evidence, disposition of
open work. Remove a redundant chronology; leave exact historical base intact.

## Payload for a new file

````markdown
---
id: "{{project_id}}-JOURNAL-{{unique_id}}"
title: "{{significant_milestone}}"
kind: journal
status: draft
created: "{{created_iso_date}}"
updated: "{{updated_iso_date}}"
areas: ["{{affected_area}}"]
summary: "{{meaningful_turn_and_why_future_readers_need_it}}"
---

# {{significant_milestone}}

## Context and change

{{period_source_revision_and_prior_state}}
{{significant_result_and_reason_not_a_complete_command_transcript}}

## Decisions and evidence

{{decisions_contracts_and_actual_checks_with_scope_links}}
{{proposal_vs_implementation_vs_test_result}}

## Disposition

